WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.030
Fog.

2
00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:05.040
A newsboy's cry rings down
the street: "Special edition.

3
00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:07.530
Shocking murder of an M.P."

4
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:13.010
Behind a lit window, two gentlemen lean
together over a letter, whispering.

5
00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:16.150
Then one of them locks
it away in his safe.

6
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.160
A man has been murdered.

7
00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:21.580
So why are his friends so
worried about a good name?

8
00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:25.220
In this mission, you'll step into
the world of Victorian gentlemen,

9
00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:28.130
and ask what a reputation
was worth to them.

10
00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:32.640
You'll hear one man threaten to "make
his name stink from one end of London to

11
00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:33.570
the other".

12
00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:38.240
And you'll find secrets kept
everywhere: a door with no knocker,

13
00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:41.300
a safe, an envelope marked private.

14
00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:45.500
Your mission: explain why his
friends worry about a good name.
